            "action_name": {
              "value": "Blood Frenzy"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: The bunyip deals bleed damage to a living creature.\n\nThe bunyip flies into a frenzy that lasts 1 minute. While frenzied, the bunyip gains a +4 status bonus to damage rolls with its jaws, gains 8 temporary HP that go away at the end of the frenzy, and takes a \u20132 penalty to AC."
            },
